---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 md:py-36 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-blue-50/40 to-indigo-50/30 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-black/[0.04]">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow circle -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[350px] bg-blue-100/50 blur-3xl -z-10 rounded-full"></div>

  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <div class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0071E3] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 reveal-item">
        FAST · STABLE · SECURE
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h2 class="text-[36px] sm:text-[50px] md:text-[60px] font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6 reveal-item">
        准备好了吗？<br />
        <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1D1D1F] via-[#0071E3] to-indigo-600">现在，连接更大的世界。</span>
      </h2>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="text-[17px] sm:text-[19px] text-[#6E6E73] font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 reveal-item">
        即刻注册，体验极速稳定的全球网络加速服务。无繁琐步骤，快速开通。
      </p>

      <!-- Primary CTA Button -->
      <div class="reveal-item">
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.registerUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-10 py-4 text-[17px] font-semibold text-white bg-[#0071E3] hover:bg-[#0077ED] rounded-full transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/25 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-500/35 active:scale-95 group"
        >
          <span>立即体验</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
